WEBVTT

00:00:01.740 --> 00:00:05.980
I believe she's looking for something.

00:00:05.980 --> 00:00:10.990
<b>This program is a work of fiction. The characters, organizations, locations, cases, etc. being portrayed are unrelated to actual events.</b>

00:00:06.860 --> 00:00:10.170
My husband and I took everything from her.

00:00:11.760 --> 00:00:18.490
Her name, her past... She was so little,
 and we took everything from her.

00:00:19.640 --> 00:00:22.790
Hello, miss. Can you tell me your name?

00:00:26.120 --> 00:00:29.250
Chateau Noble.

00:00:35.260 --> 00:00:38.460
Do you know this man?

00:00:46.760 --> 00:00:47.980
Hi there.

00:00:48.240 --> 00:00:50.500
You must be bored.

00:01:22.970 --> 00:01:26.000
A stun gun won't do much to me.

00:01:31.680 --> 00:01:33.320
Oh, Ryang-Ha...

00:01:34.240 --> 00:01:39.320
I wish I could see your face right now.

00:01:49.830 --> 00:01:51.100
Damn it!

00:01:51.850 --> 00:01:52.600
What's going on?

00:01:52.600 --> 00:01:53.460
Get him over here!

00:01:53.460 --> 00:01:55.460
Where the hell is Ryang-Ha?

00:01:57.300 --> 00:01:59.080
Hou! Don't you know where he is?

00:02:01.380 --> 00:02:05.010
Seung-Woo...

00:02:05.820 --> 00:02:07.480
Damn it, Hou!

00:04:02.500 --> 00:04:06.140
You seem like a different person, Hou.

00:04:03.840 --> 00:04:03.880
Get moving!

00:04:06.970 --> 00:04:12.140
And I never thought you'd come 
after me for a mere hostage.

00:04:12.410 --> 00:04:14.700
You've really lost your mojo, haven't you,

00:04:15.600 --> 00:04:17.150
Song Ryang-Ha?

00:04:35.150 --> 00:04:36.790
Where is she?

00:04:38.420 --> 00:04:41.490
What, you think you're some kind of hero?

00:04:41.490 --> 00:04:42.800
Don't make me laugh.

00:04:43.220 --> 00:04:47.510
Don't tell me you've forgotten 
what you did five years ago.

00:04:59.750 --> 00:05:02.070
It's too bad, Hou.

00:05:03.820 --> 00:05:10.330
Seung-Woo's last wish was for 
the two of us to get along.

00:05:11.240 --> 00:05:14.040
It really is a shame.

00:05:49.210 --> 00:05:51.110
I'll ask you one more time.

00:05:51.420 --> 00:05:53.490
Where is she?

00:05:55.790 --> 00:05:58.000
Is she that precious to you?

00:06:05.260 --> 00:06:08.790
Chateau's my guest of honor.

00:06:09.260 --> 00:06:11.760
You're not getting her back for free.

00:06:32.140 --> 00:06:34.000
Time for round two.

00:06:37.130 --> 00:06:41.200
Own up to your mistakes and die!

00:07:02.410 --> 00:07:03.450
Did you hear?

00:07:05.220 --> 00:07:09.080
Seung-Woo took in some creepy brat.

00:07:09.960 --> 00:07:13.460
One of the dogs from the assholes
 running around on our turf.

00:07:13.460 --> 00:07:15.410
I heard he's a druggie.

00:07:15.410 --> 00:07:17.080
Could be useful, I guess.

00:07:17.720 --> 00:07:20.150
Can't say I'm surprised.

00:07:20.150 --> 00:07:22.400
He grew up in the slums, too, didn't he?

00:07:23.850 --> 00:07:28.100
Must be nice not having 
an image to keep up, huh?

00:07:28.100 --> 00:07:29.970
I envy him.

00:07:29.970 --> 00:07:31.910
Hey, he can hear us.

00:07:34.410 --> 00:07:35.350
You pufferfish.

00:08:06.160 --> 00:08:12.670
<i>You're some kind of freak, 
charging into a rain of bullets.</i>

00:08:13.060 --> 00:08:15.780
<i>Did you fry your own nerves or something?</i>

00:08:17.500 --> 00:08:20.060
<i>I'm impressed, Hou.</i>

00:08:54.270 --> 00:08:54.990
Hey.

00:08:55.890 --> 00:08:58.270
You sure are something.

00:08:58.270 --> 00:09:00.610
I can't believe you're still alive.

00:09:02.330 --> 00:09:03.430
Can you stand?

00:09:04.090 --> 00:09:05.440
Your shoulder...

00:09:05.440 --> 00:09:07.480
would be nice to lean on.

00:09:12.160 --> 00:09:13.730
I can walk!

00:09:13.730 --> 00:09:14.710
Sure, sure.

00:09:14.710 --> 00:09:16.970
But let's get you out of here first.

00:09:50.350 --> 00:09:53.640
Did you finish your business?

00:09:55.470 --> 00:09:57.360
Of course I did.

00:09:57.360 --> 00:09:59.490
Are you curious? Wanna hear about it?

00:10:00.170 --> 00:10:01.780
No, I don't.

00:10:01.780 --> 00:10:04.560
Sure you do. You don't have to pretend.

00:10:04.980 --> 00:10:09.200
Still, some things don't sit quite right.

00:10:09.200 --> 00:10:11.750
Caution is still in order.

00:10:13.550 --> 00:10:15.440
Never mind that.

00:10:15.440 --> 00:10:17.360
He didn't do anything nasty to you, did he?

00:10:17.360 --> 00:10:20.090
I was so worried, I could die.

00:10:20.090 --> 00:10:25.140
<i>Does being ambushed and 
blown up not count as nasty?</i>

00:10:27.110 --> 00:10:29.540
Wow, I'm actually beat this time...

00:10:45.850 --> 00:10:48.870
Looks like it didn't work out after all.

00:10:50.550 --> 00:10:52.150
Understood.

00:10:53.350 --> 00:10:56.640
Chateau Dankworth or Song Ryang-Ha...

00:10:56.640 --> 00:10:59.600
Which one should I kill first?

00:11:05.520 --> 00:11:09.890
"I won't be back at the office today, 
so I'm counting on you to lock up for me."

00:11:10.190 --> 00:11:11.690
Jeez.

00:11:11.690 --> 00:11:15.480
I wish he'd tell me these things earlier.

00:11:16.530 --> 00:11:19.280
Everyone's so self-centered. Ugh.

00:11:27.080 --> 00:11:28.330
Chateau!

00:11:28.330 --> 00:11:31.040
Sorry, could you do me a favor?

00:11:31.040 --> 00:11:33.420
What happened to your suspension?

00:11:33.420 --> 00:11:35.370
I'll explain later.

00:11:35.370 --> 00:11:37.290
Just get in the car. Hurry.

00:11:37.290 --> 00:11:39.110
When is "later"?

00:11:41.260 --> 00:11:43.710
Who's the gentleman?

00:11:46.900 --> 00:11:49.210
I did what I could.

00:11:50.850 --> 00:11:54.060
He'd be better off with 
proper treatment, though.

00:11:54.590 --> 00:11:57.070
But you wouldn't be here 
if that was an option, huh?

00:11:57.520 --> 00:12:00.070
I'll let him use the bed for tonight.

00:12:00.660 --> 00:12:02.380
Be gone by morning, please.

00:12:10.170 --> 00:12:11.520
Chateau.

00:12:12.380 --> 00:12:13.330
A minute?

00:12:17.580 --> 00:12:20.780
How are your injuries? Are you all right?

00:12:20.780 --> 00:12:22.020
I'm fine.

00:12:22.020 --> 00:12:24.340
I just hurt my leg a little.

00:12:25.900 --> 00:12:28.620
I'm about to contact the boss.

00:12:28.620 --> 00:12:29.600
All right?

00:12:34.550 --> 00:12:37.440
I'll give him a status report.

00:12:39.230 --> 00:12:42.240
Please get some rest, Chateau.

00:12:50.020 --> 00:12:50.990
Morning.

00:12:52.650 --> 00:12:53.870
Whoops.

00:12:53.870 --> 00:12:56.000
I've never passed out before.

00:12:56.780 --> 00:12:58.210
Where are we?

00:12:59.570 --> 00:13:02.010
A particularly accommodating clinic.

00:13:02.010 --> 00:13:04.580
A colleague of mine helped find it.

00:13:06.300 --> 00:13:09.380
And another will be here soon.

00:13:09.700 --> 00:13:10.510
Yeah?

00:13:10.830 --> 00:13:13.140
So, what's your plan now?

00:13:17.500 --> 00:13:20.730
I'm going to "accidentally" doze off

00:13:20.730 --> 00:13:23.650
and pretend I know nothing of 
what happens in the meantime.

00:13:24.150 --> 00:13:26.320
Leave immediately, please.

00:13:28.940 --> 00:13:30.210
Say what?

00:13:30.210 --> 00:13:32.200
That's such a lame excuse.

00:13:32.740 --> 00:13:33.790
Ow...

00:13:33.790 --> 00:13:35.370
My wound's opening.

00:13:38.090 --> 00:13:40.340
But what are you going to do?

00:13:40.660 --> 00:13:44.380
You'll be admitting to 
having contact with me.

00:13:47.870 --> 00:13:49.860
That's my own problem.

00:13:49.860 --> 00:13:51.070
Don't worry about it.

00:13:52.850 --> 00:13:55.640
When are you gonna stop trying to fool me?

00:13:57.970 --> 00:14:02.150
You're only hanging yourself right now.

00:14:03.370 --> 00:14:05.370
You can't keep this up much longer, can you?

00:14:07.910 --> 00:14:11.990
I could just take you away from here.

00:14:14.210 --> 00:14:18.120
Your life would be so much simpler.

00:14:18.920 --> 00:14:20.630
Don't you think?

00:14:34.180 --> 00:14:38.590
I suggest you stop worrying about 
other people and focus on yourself.

00:14:38.590 --> 00:14:40.190
Hurry up and run.

00:14:41.550 --> 00:14:44.610
The car's in the alleyway to 
the left outside the back door.

00:14:45.420 --> 00:14:47.640
You may be tracked.

00:14:47.640 --> 00:14:50.490
I recommend abandoning it when appropriate.

00:14:50.970 --> 00:14:52.990
I wish you well.

00:14:55.300 --> 00:14:57.140
Well, I guess that's that.

00:14:57.140 --> 00:14:58.790
For today.

00:15:00.620 --> 00:15:03.910
I was hoping you'd give 
me a good looking-after.

00:15:03.910 --> 00:15:05.630
Shucks.

00:15:06.290 --> 00:15:08.050
I'm happy, though.

00:15:08.280 --> 00:15:10.410
You saved me.

00:15:10.410 --> 00:15:11.550
Thank you.

00:15:11.960 --> 00:15:13.860
Were you worried?

00:15:13.860 --> 00:15:16.010
Did you think I'd die?

00:15:16.010 --> 00:15:17.180
Come on.

00:15:17.450 --> 00:15:19.130
I'm asleep right now.

00:15:19.130 --> 00:15:21.190
I can't answer any questions.

00:15:21.190 --> 00:15:22.150
Zzz.

00:15:22.590 --> 00:15:24.500
"Zzz"? Really?

00:15:25.610 --> 00:15:28.110
I'll accept a date for your
 back-to-work celebration.

00:15:28.110 --> 00:15:29.560
I'm not celebrating.

00:15:29.560 --> 00:15:30.490
Zzz.

00:15:30.490 --> 00:15:32.950
Aw, why not?

00:16:34.410 --> 00:16:36.440
Oh? Did you just wake up?

00:16:37.370 --> 00:16:38.650
Good morning.

00:16:38.650 --> 00:16:41.100
You're back to work today, aren't you?

00:16:41.100 --> 00:16:43.590
We're going to have to celebrate.

00:16:44.050 --> 00:16:47.610
<i>Why does this man know my schedule?</i>

00:16:48.220 --> 00:16:51.030
<i>How are your wounds?</i>

00:16:52.220 --> 00:16:53.700
All better.

00:16:53.700 --> 00:16:55.610
It's been three weeks, you know.

00:16:56.280 --> 00:16:59.870
Speaking of which, how did your boss react?

00:17:00.720 --> 00:17:04.720
<i>He ended up seeing us together, didn't he?</i>

00:17:05.950 --> 00:17:07.300
Please, Chateau...

00:17:07.700 --> 00:17:11.130
Enough of the apology pose already.

00:17:11.470 --> 00:17:13.430
You're still suspended.

00:17:13.430 --> 00:17:16.360
You'll check in three times a day.

00:17:16.360 --> 00:17:19.390
And I'm going to keep an 
eye on your phone location.

00:17:22.060 --> 00:17:24.890
I'll need to think about 
what to do going forward.

00:17:24.890 --> 00:17:27.120
I'm prepared to accept punishment.

00:17:28.060 --> 00:17:32.130
I was in partial cooperation 
with Ryang-Ha Song.

00:17:32.130 --> 00:17:35.900
I'd be in no position to object if you sold 
us both out to another organization.

00:17:36.210 --> 00:17:37.940
I will abide by your decision.

00:17:37.940 --> 00:17:40.250
N-No, I never said—

00:17:40.250 --> 00:17:44.190
What? That's too much, Boss.

00:17:44.190 --> 00:17:47.790
What's wrong with having a collaborator?

00:17:48.110 --> 00:17:50.010
Mr. Song, was it?

00:17:50.010 --> 00:17:54.050
I think he could be plenty useful.

00:17:54.420 --> 00:17:57.050
<i>I wish they'd get lost already.</i>

00:17:57.300 --> 00:18:01.070
So I helped in getting him treated, too.

00:18:01.070 --> 00:18:03.060
Cut her some slack, dude, thank you.

00:18:05.780 --> 00:18:08.690
You're still suspended for now.

00:18:08.690 --> 00:18:10.690
So that's that.

00:18:10.690 --> 00:18:13.710
That's annoying, huh?

00:18:13.710 --> 00:18:16.200
Pretty convenient for me, though.

00:18:18.270 --> 00:18:19.950
<i>What's that sound?</i>

00:18:20.350 --> 00:18:23.950
<i>So what kind of work
are you starting today?</i>

00:18:23.950 --> 00:18:26.660
I'm not obligated to tell you.

00:18:26.900 --> 00:18:31.080
You say that, but he hasn't 
even told you, has he?

00:18:31.550 --> 00:18:34.030
<i>Because he doesn't want me to find out.</i>

00:18:34.670 --> 00:18:36.090
<i>Aha, I nailed it.</i>

00:18:37.190 --> 00:18:41.090
Anyway, I'm actually going on a little trip.

00:18:41.660 --> 00:18:42.610
Uh-huh.

00:18:43.100 --> 00:18:45.080
<i>Enjoy your vacation.</i>

00:18:45.080 --> 00:18:46.980
You're so cold!

00:18:47.280 --> 00:18:49.670
<i>You've been through a lot lately.</i>

00:18:49.670 --> 00:18:52.730
<i>Aren't you worried about
not having me around?</i>

00:18:52.730 --> 00:18:54.630
<i>No. Not at all.</i>

00:18:54.630 --> 00:18:57.310
You're really no fun.

00:18:57.310 --> 00:19:01.060
Although I'm sure we'll 
meet again soon enough.

00:19:05.190 --> 00:19:06.220
<i>Wait for me.</i>

00:19:30.550 --> 00:19:31.470
Who was that?

00:19:44.250 --> 00:19:46.990
Chateau, you look pale.

00:19:46.990 --> 00:19:47.950
Are you all right?

00:19:47.950 --> 00:19:49.670
I'm fine.

00:19:49.670 --> 00:19:52.800
It's probably because I was forced 
to sit at home for three weeks.

00:19:52.800 --> 00:19:54.660
Three whole weeks.

00:19:54.660 --> 00:19:57.960
I'm glad you're well enough to give me snark.

00:19:57.960 --> 00:20:00.470
Boss, is that it?

00:20:02.020 --> 00:20:05.170
It's so big!

00:20:07.970 --> 00:20:12.390
We gotta enjoy ourselves 
while we're here, Chateau!

00:20:13.950 --> 00:20:16.860
Jim, we're here to work.

00:20:18.440 --> 00:20:21.290
The megaliner <i>Artemisia</i>.

00:20:23.090 --> 00:20:27.870
This is her one-week maiden voyage, 
open only to company staff and invitees.

00:20:28.720 --> 00:20:33.250
We'll be disguised as guests to 
guard an important individual.

00:20:35.670 --> 00:20:38.170
That's our job.

00:20:38.400 --> 00:20:41.050
Who is this "important individual"?

00:20:41.330 --> 00:20:44.930
A financier involved in the 
travel industry on the world stage.

00:20:47.930 --> 00:20:53.060
He has connections to numerous big-shots
 in the worlds of politics and finance,

00:20:53.470 --> 00:20:56.480
but he's also made his share of enemies.

00:20:56.480 --> 00:20:58.900
He's also involved in the 
operation of this ship.

00:21:01.440 --> 00:21:04.190
Actually... he's a relative of mine.

00:21:04.190 --> 00:21:06.320
What? A relative?

00:21:06.730 --> 00:21:10.470
Anyway, stay sharp for the next seven days.

00:21:25.550 --> 00:21:27.710
I bet she'll be surprised.

00:21:36.300 --> 00:21:37.400
Thanks.

00:21:39.640 --> 00:21:43.230
Ooh! Can I have a balloon, too, Mr. Bunny?

00:21:44.800 --> 00:21:47.960
That man got a blue one, right?

00:21:47.960 --> 00:21:48.950
Let's see...

00:21:49.330 --> 00:21:51.280
Then I'll take red!

00:23:37.330 --> 00:23:39.930
Next episode: "Dark Dream."
